l the Trigger","strDescription":"Equipped a gun.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1358700/6d024b6386510c5b01c2971a5f0743f54cb82373.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":37.099998474121094,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"TROPHY_DLC1_EQUIPPED_STAFF","strName":"Path of the Staff","strDescription":"Equipped a staff.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1358700/6d024b6386510c5b01c2971a5f0743f54cb82373.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":35.900001525878906,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"TROPHY_DLC1_UNLOCKED_EVOKER","strName":"Path of the Evoker","strDescription":"Unlocked the evoker.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1358700/6d024b6386510c5b01c2971a5f0743f54cb82373.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":28.700000762939453,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"TROPHY_UNLOCK_ALL_JOB_BONUS","strName":"Polymath","strDescription":"Unlocked every job affinity bonus for a single job.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1358700/6d024b6386510c5b01c2971a5f0743f54cb82373.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":27.700000762939453,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"TROPHY_DLC3_UNLOCKED_HUNTER","strName":"On the Hunter's Path","strDescription":"Unlocked the hunter.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1358700/6d024b6386510c5b01c2971a5f0743f54cb82373.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":26.399999618530273,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"TROPHY_DLC3_UNLOCKED_GAMBLER","strName":"Take a Chance","strDescription":"Unlocked the gambler.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1358700/6d024b6386510c5b01c2971a5f0743f54cb82373.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":22.100000381469727,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"TROPHY_FULL_UPGRADE_SPECIAL_EFFECT","strName":"True Potential","strDescription":"Fully upgraded the special effect of a piece of equipment.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/1358700/6d024b6386510c5b01c2971a5f0743f54cb82373.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":21.5,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":83,"nAchieved":0}}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Square Enix","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/developer/squareenix"},{"strName":"KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD.","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/developer/KOEITECMO"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Square Enix","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/squareenix"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"FINAL FANTASY","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/34459938"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"With the memory of their struggle buried deep in their hearts...\r\n\r\nFight your way through fierce battles with a variety of means to defeat your enemies. With multiple difficulty options and a wide selection of jobs and weapons available to customize your party, you can choose exactly how you want to play.\r\n\r\nWill restoring the crystals' light usher in peace or a new form of darkness? ...Or perhaps something else entirely?\r\n\r\nThis game features memorable locales from other entries in the FINAL FANTASY series.\r\n\r\nPravoka Seagrot recalls Sastasha of FINAL FANTASY XIV. Beyond the cave's mystical landscape of vividly colored coral lies the pirates' hideout where their ship is anchored.\r\n\r\nHallowed Massif recalls Mt. Gagazet of FINAL FANTASY X. Fierce blizzards and avalanches impede the progress of travelers, while graven figures sleep within the mountain.\r\n\r\nOther areas and battle music also draw inspiration from the main titles in the series, providing FINAL FANTASY fans with plenty of familiar tidbits to stoke nostalgia and make the game even more enjoyable.\r\n\r\n*Various game contents require an internet connection.","strSnippet":"Developed in cooperation between Square Enix and Team NINJA (Koei Tecmo Games), STRANGER OF PARADISE FINAL FANTASY ORIGIN is a hard-core action RPG that takes the FINAL FANTASY series in a new direction. Experience the boldest and most merciless battles in FINAL FANTASY history."}}],["achievementmap",{"version":5,"data":"[]"}],["usernews",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["gameactivity",{"version":5,"data":[]}]]